  action: ANNOTATED
  changes: 'Edison LITERATURE (PaperQA3) identity research; report at research/ingredients/Mineral_Salts_Medium_Base-edison-literature.md
    (local artifact — research/ is gitignored, so the findings are quoted here rather
    than linked). Report verdict: ## Executive recommendation — **Retain `UNMAPPED`
    and `DEFINED_MEDIUM`.** “Mineral salts medium base” is not a single chemical,
    salt, hydrate, buffer, or uniquely defined commercial product. It is an underspecified
    label for a **family of chemically defined, predominantly inorganic culture-medium
    formulations**. Published formulations bearing closely related names differ in
    their nitrogen source,  No ontology CURIE was proposed. Recorded as provenance
